---
// Honest launch-mode social proof block.
// Until real customer stories come in, this section frames the launch openly:
// "we're brand-new, be a founding buyer, your name + result goes here."
// When you have 3+ real customer testimonials, replace this whole component
// with the testimonial grid pattern (3 cards: quote / name / role).
interface Props {
  bundle?: any;
}
---
<section class="py-24 px-5 sm:px-8 border-t border-edge">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">

    <div data-reveal class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Launch week</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-4">
        Be a founding buyer. Your story goes here.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Loadout launched <span class="text-white font-medium">this week</span>.
        I'd rather show you real results from real buyers than make up testimonials before any exist.
        Buy in the first wave, email me what changed in your week, and your name + outcome lives in this spot.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" class="p-6 rounded-lg border border-edge bg-surface-2 flex flex-col">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Founding buyer #1</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed italic flex-1 mb-6">
          "Your specific result — a number, a deal saved, a follow-up that landed — goes here once you've used it for a week."
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-edge pt-4">
          <p class="text-dim text-sm">— You, probably, in seven days.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" class="p-6 pt-9 rounded-lg border border-accent/40 bg-surface-2 flex flex-col relative">
        <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white bg-accent px-3 py-1 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap">$20 off code: FOUNDING</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">First 50 buyers</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1 mb-6">
          The first 50 buyers get the founding discount and a permanent slot in this section if they send a one-paragraph result. Honest deal, no scarcity tricks — when 50 are gone, the code stops working.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-edge pt-4">
          <p class="text-dim text-sm">Use <span class="text-white font-mono">FOUNDING</span> at checkout.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3" class="p-6 rounded-lg border border-edge bg-surface-2 flex flex-col">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Founding buyer #2</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed italic flex-1 mb-6">
          "The specific objection this killed for you — 'I'm not a tech person', or 'I already have a CRM' — and how the setup answered it."
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-edge pt-4">
          <p class="text-dim text-sm">— Someone in your shoes, a week from now.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
